### ============================================================
### TC-P05 — Salud y Documentación de la API
### ============================================================

### Health check (liveness) → 200
# @name health_check
GET http://localhost:8080/q/health

### Ready check (incluye DB) → 200 o 503
# @name readiness_check
GET http://localhost:8080/q/health/ready

### DB health check → 200 o 503
# @name health_db
GET http://localhost:8080/q/health/ready/db

### OpenAPI spec (JSON) → 200
# @name openapi_json
GET http://localhost:8080/q/openapi

### Swagger UI
# Abrir en navegador: http://localhost:8080/q/swagger-ui
